  "body": "**Stacked on #118** (issue #80) - both change the cross-drill path. Before #118 merges, retarget this PR to `main` (`gh pr edit <this> --base main`), then merge #118, then this.\n\nCross holes on box stock enter at the face, not the corner radius (issue #85).\n\n**What changed**\n- New `crates/app/src/operation/cross_entry.rs`: per cross hole, the entry where the drill first touches stock - stock facets clipped to a square tube of half-width d/2 around the hole's own line (spindle frame), outermost point; the tube contains the round drill, so the entry is never nearer the axis than the real first contact (#77's edge rule kept). The shank's extra reach (#84) is read the same way at its half-width.\n- Round bars stay bit-identical: the mesh reading replaces the corner circle only when the crossing sits more than `raw·(1−cos(π/16))` (~1.9% of the radius) inside it - chords of a 16+-sided polygon never trigger it. No facet in the tube -> corner circle (documented).\n- `rapids_clear`: a rapid along a hole's own line is proved against that per-line entry (drill at the tip, a wider shank one flute behind); every other rapid (station hops, swings, start/end) still stands off the corner radius + rim.\n\n| Case | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| 60x60 box, on-axis hole | mouth r42.43 | r30 |\n| 44 square bar, hole to x -8 | read 39.11 mm deep, 35 mm flute refused | 30 mm, posts |\n| 60 box, 30 mm flute | refused at 35.43 mm | drills |\n| 60 box, off-centre 6 mm drill | refused at 38.10 mm | mouth at the x=30 face |\n\n**Pinned by** `drilling_cross_box::{a_30_deep_hole_from_the_face_of_a_44_square_bar_posts_on_a_35_flute, a_60_box_mouth_sits_at_the_face_not_the_corner_radius, an_off_centre_hole_on_a_box_face_enters_at_the_face, the_station_change_hop_still_clears_the_box_corners, a_cylinder_stock_chain_is_unchanged_bit_for_bit}` (all failed before) + a unit test; `drilling_cross_stock`'s box test now asserts per-line entries.\n\n**Gates**: drilling_cross_box 5, drilling_cross_stock 8, drilling_cross_spindle 6, drilling_cross 9, drilling_cross_rapids 2, lathe_cross_drill 4, drill_reach 6, drill_reach_fit 3, drilling_axial 7, posting 17, conformance 5, golden_cl 23, app lib 63 - green; clippy clean.\n\n**Follow-up**: the holder check still uses the corner radius - issue #119.\n\nChangelog: fix(app): cross holes on box stock enter at the face, not the corner radius - no air drilling, and the reach check reads depth from the face (a 30 mm hole in a 44 mm square bar posts on a 35 mm flute)\n\nFixes #85\n",
